{"id":"638981","name":"香酥椒盐小麻花","author":"红•宏","authorId":"10737312","desc":"","cover":"images/638981/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"理发","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/638981/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将所有食材放进面粉里用筷子搅拌絮状。","img":"images/638981/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团醒发至两倍大。","img":"images/638981/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"慢慢的蜂窝状。","img":"images/638981/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切成大小均匀的剂子松弛15分钟。","img":"images/638981/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搓成条刷一层油。","img":"images/638981/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"从第一个开始搓条。","img":"images/638981/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"两手反方向搓。","img":"images/638981/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"像搓绳子一样上劲，一个生胚就做好了。","img":"images/638981/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"依次做好的麻花。","img":"images/638981/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"起锅烧油，油温五成热小火开始炸，炸成金黄色捞出。","img":"images/638981/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"咸香酥脆的小麻花出锅喽。","img":"images/638981/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/638981/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"我加的是花生油，猪油效果会更好，家里没有了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}